    "Ask Wicker — \"run a full analysis on %@\" — and the multi-agent desk (fundamental / technical / sentiment / news → bull-bear debate → trade → risk) will kick off. Completed reports get archived here for side-by-side comparison.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让旺财「对 %@ 做一次完整分析」——多智能体团队（基本面 / 技术面 / 情绪面 / 新闻面 → 多空辩论 → 交易 → 风控）就会启动。完成的报告会归档在此，便于对比。"
          }
