    "Drives the Wicker workflow by shelling out to your locally-installed `claude` CLI. Uses whichever subscription `claude login` is signed into — no API key here. Each desk run is ~10-20 s slower than a direct API call and bills against your Pro/Max quota; not recommended for high-frequency use.": {
